=head1 NAME

_GET_POINTING_LOG_INFO_ - Assemble additional information for pointing logs

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This primitive prepares information which may be useful to include
in pointing log files.  This will include information found in the
frame header values.

=head1 ARGUMENTS

=over 4

=item B<DAZ>

Calculated offset in azimuth.

=item B<DEL>

Calculated offset in elevation.

=back

=head1 OUTPUT DATA

=over 4

=item B<INFO>

Reference to a hash containing:

=over 4

=item B<AZ>

=item B<EL>

=item B<UAZ> (initial UAZ + DAZ)

=item B<UEL> (initial UEL + UEL)

=item B<URA> (UAZ, UEL rotated to RA)

=item B<UDEC> (UAZ, UEL rotated to DEC)

=back

=back

=head1 NOTES

Currently assumes the telescope (location) is (that of) JCMT.

